---
source: crates/instrukt-cli/tests/harness.rs
expression: help
---
The work record and workflow (todos module)

Usage: instrukt todo <COMMAND>

Commands:
  create      Record a new todo with its kind and intent
  list        The project's work: active by default, or iceboxed, removed or delivered
  show        A todo's record, evidence, holds, claim and session bindings
  update      Change a todo's metadata, relationships, hold or claim
  refresh     Refresh a conflicted todo from GitHub
  freeze      Park a todo in the icebox
  unfreeze    Return a parked todo to active consideration
  remove      Withdraw a todo, retained for recovery
  reactivate  Restore withdrawn work
  deliver     Record the confirmed delivered commit
  stamp       Record an attributed fact bound to evidence
  artifacts   List, read, write and diff a todo's artifacts
  prepare     A todo's next preparation obligation (deliberate pickup)
  work        A todo's next delivery obligation (deliberate pickup)
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
